# Platform: mobilesite
# Imported from Testsigma: NCT Job-related Questions (run 114314, B2B Touch (8AM), Samsung Galaxy S24)
# Lines starting with '# UNSUPPORTED' or '# IF' need a manual decision.
# Tags: regression
# REAL LEADS: the Send Enquiry submit + OTP steps and the Get Best Price submit are OFF so scheduled runs never send
#   leads to clients. Switch them on only when a lead is wanted.
# Get Best Price 'No' option: only shown to a signed-in user (the OTP enquiry used to sign in), so it is OFF too.
# Other OFF steps: the mobile Send Enquiry form has no Name field; mobile Get Best Price keeps Submit disabled
#   until an option is chosen (no 'Please select one option' text); three pop-up checks near the top are also OFF.

open https://www.justdial.com/Mumbai/Multinational-Companies-in-Link-Road-Malad-West/nct-10332493?fl=undefined&ismap=undefined&subpage=&searchCase=&term=multinat&searchLocUpdate=0&jdxflag=0&ll=searchbox&cbflg=1&stype=category_list&srcterm=Multinational%20Companies&trkid=13116826-mumbai
wait for page to load
call PS_Touch_Consent_Popup
# Live 06-Oct-2026 (GJDT-22177 / GJDT-22700): the company-card CTA is now "Get Best Price" instead of "Send Enquiry"
# (a card still shows Send Enquiry only for some seller plans - data, not something to depend on).
# Logged out, Get Best Price opens the login sheet; the lead itself is never sent from here.
# Live 02-Oct-2026: the 'Are you looking for job?' sheet pops up on scroll (GJDT-22010) - group skips it
call SG_NCT_Scroll_To_Get_Best_Price_Skipping_Job_Sheet
click get_best_price_any_button
wait until element nct_login_ask_for_price is visible
verify element prp_open_rfq_login_pop_jd_logo is visible
verify element nct_login_text_ask_for_price is visible
verify element prp_login_mobile is visible
click touch_login_popup_may_be_later
wait until element nct_login_ask_for_price is not visible
click if visible enquiry_seller_pop_skip
# OFF (Send Enquiry page gone with the CTA change): verify element heading_send_enquiry_ps is visible
# OFF (Send Enquiry page gone with the CTA change): verify text "Get the free contact details in seconds for Multinational Companies" on page
# OFF (Send Enquiry page gone with the CTA change): verify element heading_free_contact_details_ps is visible
# OFF (Send Enquiry page gone with the CTA change): seller call pop-up checks (call_popup_seller_name, seller_call_pop_*, seller_user_details_form, enquiry_default_text)
# OFF (Send Enquiry form gone with the CTA change): type "${mobile_7738}" into enquiry_form_mobile / click enquiry_form_no / submit + OTP
open https://www.justdial.com/Mumbai/Corporate-Companies-in-Link-Road-Malad-West/nct-10138533?fl=undefined&ismap=undefined&subpage=&searchCase=&term=corporate%2520com&searchLocUpdate=0&jdxflag=0&ll=searchbox&cbflg=1&stype=category_list&srcterm=Corporate%20Companies&trkid=13702-mumbai
wait 4 seconds
scroll until text "Placement Services" visible, scroll count 20, scroll wait 1
verify text "Placement Services" on page
scroll until text "Get Best Price" visible, scroll count 10, scroll wait 1
click if visible enquiry_seller_pop_skip
# Live 06-Oct-2026: logged out, Get Best Price first asks to log in; the job sheet comes after login.
# (the old 11th-card click depended on 11 cards being loaded - not needed)
click get_best_price_any_button
wait until element nct_login_ask_for_price is visible
type "${mobile_9987}" into prp_login_mobile
js click nct_login_pop_continue_button
type "${otp}" into nct_login_otp_field
wait until element nct_login_ask_for_price is not visible
# after login the list is shown again - tap Get Best Price once more to get the job sheet
click get_best_price_any_button
wait until element gbp_sheet_heading is visible
verify element gbp_sheet_heading is visible
# OFF: click gbp_submit_now_button
# OFF: verify text "Please select one option" on page
# OFF: click get_best_price_page_no_radio_button
# OFF: click gbp_submit_now_button
# OFF: verify text "Dear Prashant" on page
wait 1 seconds
click if visible get_best_price_header_back
click if visible enquiry_seller_pop_skip
open https://www.justdial.com/Mumbai/Multinational-Companies-in-Link-Road-Malad-West/nct-10332493?fl=undefined&ismap=undefined&subpage=&searchCase=&term=multinat&searchLocUpdate=0&jdxflag=0&ll=searchbox&cbflg=1&stype=category_list&srcterm=Multinational%20Companies&trkid=13116826-mumbai
wait for page to load
# Live 06-Oct-2026: Send Enquiry replaced by Get Best Price on the company card (GJDT-22177).
# Signed in now (login above), so Get Best Price opens the job sheet straight away.
call SG_NCT_Scroll_To_Get_Best_Price_Skipping_Job_Sheet
click get_best_price_any_button
wait until element gbp_sheet_heading is visible
verify page does not contain "Need Immediate Assistance"
click if visible get_best_price_header_back
